00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
Destroyed the game stage to the hall 

2
00:00:05,082 --> 00:00:10,482
Hello, everyone. I'm Yuri Kitagawa, from Nogizaka 46.

3
00:00:10,482 --> 00:00:14,682
I'm Sakura Kawasaki. Pleased to meet you.

4
00:00:14,682 --> 00:00:21,482
Today we'd like to do the arena only.

5
00:00:21,482 --> 00:00:23,482
Let's do our best. Let's do our best.

6
00:00:23,482 --> 00:00:30,982
I'd be happy if you could study or work with me while watching this.

7
00:00:30,982 --> 00:00:34,482
I'd like to do it.

8
00:00:34,482 --> 00:00:43,482
Today, we're going to concentrate for 20 minutes and then take a 5 minute break, and I hope we can repeat this 3 times.

9
00:00:43,482 --> 00:00:48,482
Let's concentrate and work hard together.

10
00:00:48,482 --> 00:00:52,482
By the way, what are you working on today?

11
00:00:52,482 --> 00:00:58,482
I have a lot of reports that are due for mid-term exams.

12
00:00:58,482 --> 00:01:02,482
I'm hoping to get as far as I can with one of them.

13
00:01:02,482 --> 00:01:04,482
What year are you in? I'm in my second year.

14
00:01:04,482 --> 00:01:07,482
Sophomore. Yeah, there are a lot of reports.

15
00:01:07,482 --> 00:01:13,482
There are a lot of them, so I'd like to finish at least one of them.

16
00:01:13,482 --> 00:01:15,482
What are you working on, Yuri?

17
00:01:15,482 --> 00:01:20,482
Yuri, you have one report and one...

18
00:01:20,482 --> 00:01:25,482
Yuri, you have to write one report and one review of a project you've been working on.

19
00:01:25,482 --> 00:01:30,482
I'm a professor, so I'll do my best to finish them in this time.

20
00:01:30,482 --> 00:01:32,482
Let's be like that.

21
00:01:33,482 --> 00:01:37,482
Yuri, four of these.

22
00:01:37,482 --> 00:01:43,482
I drink a lot when I'm studying.

23
00:01:43,482 --> 00:01:48,482
I don't know if my body temperature rises when I'm concentrating, but...

24
00:01:48,482 --> 00:01:53,482
I drink to cool myself down.

25
00:01:53,482 --> 00:01:58,482
I drink water, black tea, and my favorite black tea.

26
00:01:58,482 --> 00:02:03,482
There are about four kinds of smoothies.

27
00:02:04,482 --> 00:02:06,482
You can see this too!

28
00:02:06,482 --> 00:02:10,482
We also have two kinds of tapioca.

29
00:02:10,482 --> 00:02:15,482
If I get sleepy, I have black tea, and if I want to lower my body temperature, I have water.

30
00:02:15,482 --> 00:02:17,482
You use them differently.

31
00:02:17,482 --> 00:02:24,482
You open them all and take a sip at a time, and you can't finish studying until you've drunk them all.

32
00:02:24,482 --> 00:02:30,482
I drank a lot of tapioca while studying in high school.

33
00:02:30,482 --> 00:02:35,482
I would sneak out of school after school to buy tapioca and hide it in my bag.

34
00:02:35,482 --> 00:02:38,482
I would go back to school and study.

35
00:02:38,482 --> 00:02:44,482
Now, I'd like to start the 20-minute segment.

36
00:02:44,482 --> 00:02:47,482
Is everyone ready for the 20 minutes?

37
00:02:47,482 --> 00:02:48,482
Are you ready?

38
00:02:48,482 --> 00:02:49,482
Yes, I'm fine.

39
00:02:50,482 --> 00:02:54,482
So let's concentrate for 20 minutes.

40
00:02:54,482 --> 00:02:57,482
Here we go!

